@baseUrl = {{baseUrl}}
@jwt = {{jwt}}
@requestId = {{requestId}}
@outboxMessageId = {{outboxMessageId}}

### Listar outbox EMAIL
# Requiere ADMINISTRADOR.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/notification-outbox?channel=EMAIL&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Listar outbox por estado
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/notification-outbox?channel=EMAIL&status=FAILED&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Detalle outbox
# No expone payload completo.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/notification-outbox/{{outboxMessageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}

### Requeue outbox
# Requiere ADMINISTRADOR.
# Solo aplica a mensajes FAILED o DEAD.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/notification-outbox/{{outboxMessageId}}/requeue
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt}}
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
